sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant EH as eval-hub service
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Adapter as Adapter container<br/>(LightEval / Inspect)<br/>no listener
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub sidecar<br/>localhost:8080 HTTP
    participant Model as Model endpoint<br/>KServe / vLLM
    participant Judge as Judge endpoint<br/>api.openai.com 443/TCP
    participant HF as Hugging Face / GitHub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>HTTP(S) per config
    participant OCI as OCI registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over EH,OCI: Flow 1 - Benchmark job execution
    EH->>K8s: Create Job (adapter image, JobSpec ConfigMap at /meta,<br/>projected model-auth secret, sidecar)<br/>TLS, eval-hub SA token
    K8s-->>Adapter: Start Job pod (python main.py)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Read /meta/job.json, /var/run/secrets/model/*,<br/>/test_data (volume mounts)
    Adapter->>Sidecar: report_status INITIALIZING ... RUNNING_EVALUATION<br/>HTTP, SDK-managed auth
    Sidecar->>EH: Relay JobPhase status
    loop For each benchmark sample
        Adapter->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions or /v1/completions (echo+logprobs)<br/>HTTP loopback, Bearer reference token or "dummy"
        Sidecar->>Model: Forward with real API key or SA token<br/>HTTP/HTTPS per endpoint
        Model-->>Sidecar: Completion / logprobs
        Sidecar-->>Adapter: Response
    end
    opt Online mode (HF_HUB_OFFLINE unset)
        Adapter->>HF: Download datasets / tokenizers / task assets<br/>TLS, optional HF_TOKEN
        HF-->>Adapter: Data
    end
    Adapter->>Sidecar: report_status POST_PROCESSING
    opt MLflow configured
        Adapter->>MLflow: callbacks.mlflow.save (metrics, params, artifacts)<br/>SDK-managed credentials
    end
    opt config.exports.oci set
        Adapter->>OCI: create_oci_artifact (result files / Inspect logs)<br/>TLS, SDK-managed credentials
    end
    Adapter->>Sidecar: report_results (COMPLETED)
    Sidecar->>EH: Relay results (409 on duplicate COMPLETED)
    Adapter->>Adapter: exit 0 (success) / exit 1 (failure)

    Note over Adapter,Judge: Flow 2 - LLM-as-judge scoring (Inspect Petri / HLE / StrongREJECT)
    Adapter->>Model: Auditor role request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer
    Adapter->>Model: Target role request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Bearer
    Adapter->>Judge: Judge / grader request (OPENAI_JUDGE_BASE_URL)<br/>HTTPS TLS, Bearer OPENAI_JUDGE_API_KEY
    Judge-->>Adapter: Scores
